# Auto-generated by matugen from the current wallpaper — do not hand-edit.
# ANSI 1-6/9-14 use only matugen's native Material roles (primary/secondary/
# tertiary/error) — no [config.custom_colors] seeds. That's only 4 distinct
# hues, so magenta reuses secondary's hue (different tone than green) and
# cyan reuses tertiary's hue (different tone than yellow).
